    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2940840/extras/c22717ec66acd8fba5fc8e20f2f0ad17.avif?t=1754080043\" width=540 height=156 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stella is a deckbuilder roguelike where you journey through space. You will discover stars, planets, and moons all with their own unique effects. There are also elements that grant you passive effects that significantly impact the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are 4 main ways to increase your score</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>add</strong>\u00a0x - adds x to the score</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>mult </strong>x\u00a0- multiplies the score by x</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>final add</strong>\u00a0x - adds x to the score at the end</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>final mult</strong>\u00a0x - multiplies the score by x at the end</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>add</strong>\u00a0and<strong> mult</strong>\u00a0trigger when the card is played,<strong> final add</strong>\u00a0and<strong> final mult</strong>\u00a0trigger after the last card is played.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2940840/extras/32ccd91d8e2a4c68666895c2dcd12dce.avif?t=1754080043\" width=340 height=68 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Elements have powerful effects that will let you increase your score even more. Discover synergies with cards to create exponential score gains.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2940840/extras/a4dafd5db98f1edfee2d1802caf5324b.avif?t=1754080043\" width=554 height=158 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are multiple decks to choose from, each with their own unique strategies and effects on the game. Unlock increasing levels of difficulty as you play and try to beat every deck on the highest difficulty.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2940840/extras/c22717ec66acd8fba5fc8e20f2f0ad17.avif?t=1754080043\" width=540 height=156 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stella is a deckbuilder roguelike where you journey through space. You will discover stars, planets, and moons all with their own unique effects. There are also elements that grant you passive effects that significantly impact the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are 4 main ways to increase your score</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>add</strong>\u00a0x - adds x to the score</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>mult </strong>x\u00a0- multiplies the score by x</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>final add</strong>\u00a0x - adds x to the score at the end</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>final mult</strong>\u00a0x - multiplies the score by x at the end</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>add</strong>\u00a0and<strong> mult</strong>\u00a0trigger when the card is played,<strong> final add</strong>\u00a0and<strong> final mult</strong>\u00a0trigger after the last card is played.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2940840/extras/32ccd91d8e2a4c68666895c2dcd12dce.avif?t=1754080043\" width=340 height=68 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Elements have powerful effects that will let you increase your score even more. Discover synergies with cards to create exponential score gains.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2940840/extras/a4dafd5db98f1edfee2d1802caf5324b.avif?t=1754080043\" width=554 height=158 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are multiple decks to choose from, each with their own unique strategies and effects on the game. Unlock increasing levels of difficulty as you play and try to beat every deck on the highest difficulty.</p>",
